WEBVTT

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.930
RESTARTING SAIKI KUSUO
PART 1

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.020
<i>My name is Kusuo Saiki.</i>
<i>I'm an ordinary high school student.</i>

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.230
<i>But I have a not-so-ordinary secret.</i>

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.240
<i>I used to be a psychic.</i>

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.070
<i>I had various psychic abilities such as</i>

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:34.950
<i>telepathy, clairvoyance,</i>
<i>and teleportation.</i>

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:36.910
<i>I've even saved the world</i>
<i>a couple of times with those abilities.</i>

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:41.120
<i>However, for various reasons,</i>
<i>I've decided to seal the abilities.</i>

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>Now, I live my everyday life</i>
<i>as an ordinary high school student.</i>

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:45.790
Q: IS IT 8TH-GRADE SYNDROME?

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:46.960
<i>No.</i>

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.090
<i>Here is the familiar PK Academy.</i>

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:50.210
I went to the former classroom by mistake!

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.300
You should learn it already.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:54.260
-We're lucky, aren't we?
-About what?

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:56.760
What do you mean, "what"?
I mean that, of course.

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:00.810
<i>Because the prettiest girl, Teruhashi,</i>
<i>is our classmate this year again!</i>

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:01.720
Good morning, guys.

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:05.140
I'm super lucky to be able to see her
up close everyday!

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.400
Yeah, right, but I'm not sure
if we're truly lucky.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:08.690
Why not? This is awesome.

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:11.320
Because there's also the most idiot guy,
Nendou...

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.030
Hey, I went to the middle school
that I used to go by mistake.

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:16.030
...and the 8th-grade syndrome guy,
Kaidou in our class.

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:18.660
I will make you a prey
of my "Flame of Black."

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:21.620
<i>There's even a former gangster, Kuboyasu,</i>
<i>who'd be terrifying when he's mad.</i>

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:23.290
Hey, Shun, don't make us alarmed
so early in the morning.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:26.210
<i>In addition, the rich dictator, Saiko...</i>

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:27.580
Get out of my way, poor guys.

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:29.790
<i>...and the pervert monk, Toritsuka,</i>
<i>who's called "Germ" by girls.</i>

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:32.340
-Don't you feel the fate between us?
-Don't talk to me, Germ!

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.800
-Hey! What's wrong?
-Nothing...

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:36.430
<i>Well, there's Hairo at least...</i>

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:38.260
There are more weird guys...

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:40.300
Right, that's why I'm not sure
if we're lucky.

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:41.510
<i>I totally agree.</i>

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:45.020
<i>At least, I'm not lucky at all.</i>
<i>It's rather a disaster to me.</i>

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:49.150
<i>I used to resist them</i>
<i>with my psychic abilities, but now...</i>

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:50.310
Okay, have a seat, everybody.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:52.400
<i>Look at my situation.</i>

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:57.700
<i>Did they really shuffle the deck of cards?</i>
<i>I've almost got the same set of cards.</i>

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.780
<i>I still believe psychic abilities are</i>
<i>unnecessary, but I feel inconveniences.</i>

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.200
Hey, Saiki.

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:04.200
-Saiki?
<i>-Don't scare me.</i>

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.660
<i>I'm not used to being talked to</i>
<i>without notice.</i>

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:09.750
Why didn't you come yesterday?
We were waiting for you.

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:13.340
You said you had something to tell us.
What was it?

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:16.050
-Kaidou, be quiet.
-Sorry.

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:17.760
<i>About yesterday...</i>

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:20.640
<i>After I'd succeeded in eliminating</i>
<i>my psychic abilities,</i>

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:24.810
<i>I asked all related people to see me</i>
<i>to tell them the truth.</i>

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:27.730
<i>But something unexpected happened.</i>

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:30.310
<i>I think my psychic power caused it.</i>

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.730
<i>But I was not able to use my power again</i>
<i>after that.</i>

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:34.650
DO NOT TOUCH

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:37.150
<i>It wasn't me? Or...</i>

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:41.240
<i>I need to find out what happened</i>
<i>before I confess to them.</i>

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:42.160
Saiki.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:44.490
Saiki?

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.830
<i>Don't talk to me all of a sudden!</i>

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:48.710
-Are you okay?
<i>-I'm not!</i>

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:53.170
<i>Oh, well, I thought I'd be free from</i>
<i>nuisances if I lost my psychic abilities.</i>

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:58.260
<i>Well, it can't be helped. I can no longer</i>
<i>do things that I was doing since birth.</i>

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:02.470
<i>Clairvoyance, for example. I could see</i>
<i>through just by looking at them.</i>

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.760
<i>But I can't see through anything</i>
<i>even if I try.</i>

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:08.770
<i>I can see them as they are</i>
<i>instead of skeletons.</i>

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:15.070
<i>Yeah, they are right.</i>
<i>Now I realize that...</i>

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:19.900
<i>she does have a chiseled face</i>
<i>more than anyone else.</i>

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:23.700
<i>Aside from her personality,</i>

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.160
<i>I admit that her appearance is</i>
<i>definitely pretty.</i>

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.290
<i>Shoot! I got carried away</i>
<i>and stared at her too long.</i>

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:33.500
<i>What was that?</i>
<i>Is anything wrong with my face?</i>

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:35.920
<i>No, my face has never been wrong!</i>

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.260
Have you decided which one you want?

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:43.470
For the geography class. We need to
pick a country other than Japan from G7

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:45.100
to do research on.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.100
CANADA - GERMANY - USA
ITALY - ENGLAND - FRANCE

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:49.810
You have to pick one and submit it.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:53.230
<i>Work with those who have picked</i>
<i>the same country.</i>

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:54.520
<i>Right, now I remember.</i>

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.230
Which one did you choose?
I've already submitted my choice.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.150
<i>I have to choose one really carefully.</i>

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:03.320
<i>Sorry for her, but I have to avoid being</i>
<i>in the same group with her</i>

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.280
<i>because we'd get attention from the class.</i>

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:10.000
<i>If only I could use telepathy,</i>
<i>I could easily avoid it. No, don't!</i>

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.290
<i>He's thinking so seriously.</i>

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:15.580
<i>I don't need psychic abilities. I've seen</i>
<i>enough of the true side of people.</i>

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:17.500
<i>I can make a guess</i>
<i>without psychic abilities.</i>

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:20.420
<i>It's a one-sixth possibility.</i>
<i>I should be able to avoid it easily.</i>

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:25.890
RESTARTING SAIKI KUSUO
PART 2

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:26.850
LIBRARY

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:29.810
Okay, now let's do research
about politics and the society of Canada.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:31.680
<i>Yes, I knew it.</i>

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.770
-I really envy him.
-Saiki!

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.270
-My Teruhashi.
-He's so lucky!

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:38.190
<i>I was going to avoid this, but I kind of</i>
<i>knew that I'd end up being with her.</i>

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:39.230
Let's do our best.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:41.070
<i>Was it precognition?</i>

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:45.950
But I was surprised that we were
the only ones who chose Canada.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:48.530
<i>No, it wasn't. This is much worse</i>
<i>than I could ever foresee.</i>

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.120
Can't believe they are alone!

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.450
Shit! I guessed wrong!

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:52.370
<i>Yeah, I guessed wrong, too.</i>

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.040
<i>So, he was thinking seriously</i>
<i>trying to be in the same group with me.</i>

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:57.420
<i>And just two of us!</i>

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:59.710
<i>God loves us!</i>

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:02.420
All right,
let's go find books for research.

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:03.630
He really gets on my nerves!

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:07.800
He's been cocky. So annoying.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.810
He sits next to her,
so he must've peeked at her paper.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:11.350
-How dare he!
-How dare he!

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:15.560
<i>Now, all I can do is work hard</i>
<i>and finish this as soon as possible.</i>

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:16.730
<i>Where are the books I need?</i>

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:18.440
<i>Books about Canada...</i>

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:20.690
<i>This? No, not this one.</i>
<i>Not this one either.</i>

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:22.320
<i>Too many confusing titles.</i>

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.360
<i>This is a waste of time. Second sight!</i>

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:27.030
<i>That... is not available.</i>

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:28.950
<i>There it is.</i>

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:34.410
<i>Again, you gotta forget</i>
<i>about using psychokinesis.</i>

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:38.630
<i>Good grief, I can't help but I try to use</i>
<i>my psychic abilities unconsciously.</i>

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:42.630
<i>I'm just a crazy guy with his eyes crossed</i>
<i>and hand up in the air.</i>

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:46.470
<i>You can't do levitation.</i>
<i>Don't you get it already?</i>

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.510
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:51.640
<i>Right, I need a ladder.</i>
<i>I'll get it with psychokinesis... No!</i>

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.600
Hey, what the hell are you doing there?

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:55.640
You're really annoying...

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.810
What the hell? He's so frightened!

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:02.440
-So lame!
-Will you be quiet in the library?

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:03.940
Oops, she told me off.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.440
Stop right there.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:08.280
Don't be cocky.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:11.620
Don't be puffed up just because
you sit next to Teruhashi!

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:15.250
Don't misunderstand!
She has no feelings for you.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:17.120
<i>He is picking on me</i>
<i>like a little girl does.</i>

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:19.750
Teruhashi doesn't care about you!

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:20.830
Don't be too friendly to her!

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.380
<i>Good grief.</i>

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:27.220
<i>I can just ignore them, but I should do</i>
<i>something to avoid further nuisance.</i>

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:29.010
<i>I'm going to teach them a lesson.</i>

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:31.760
<i>I can do it at ease.</i>

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:33.390
What the hell...

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:34.850
<i>Even without psychic abilities...</i>

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.230
You bastard!

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:43.520
Saiki, did you find the book?

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:45.360
You're the man, Saiki!

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.860
You're such a funny boy!

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:50.030
You're my best friend forever!

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:50.950
Saiki?

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:53.910
Teruhashi! Sorry!
We just couldn't stop talking with him.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:56.040
We're so close to him.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:58.710
You are? Sorry to disturb you,
but can I go back to work with him?

00:06:58.790 --> 00:06:59.620
Sure!

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:03.460
I found some books on Canada.

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.340
<i>I wonder what they were talking about?</i>

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:11.300
This is pretty hard for just two of us.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:13.760
I wonder if we can finish this
by tomorrow.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:16.810
<i>No worries. I can finish it</i>
<i>using thoughtography.</i>

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:18.350
<i>I can't use it though.</i>

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:26.520
There's too much information
about France.

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:28.990
Let's go to a cafe to do the rest, Kaidou.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:30.490
Sorry, I have tutoring today.

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:31.950
Oh, shoot.

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:33.570
I will come with you.

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:36.700
How about Cafe Mami? It's usually empty,
so they wouldn't mind if you stay long.

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:40.120
How courageous. She asked Kaidou out
without hesitation.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:41.540
<i>So, Kaidou picked France.</i>

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.170
Well, if you have time,

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.590
how about going somewhere
to work on the rest?

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:49.510
Because the library is closing soon.

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:52.510
Maybe we can go to a family restaurant
or even your house.

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:55.260
Hey, haven't you guys finished it yet?
We've done it already!

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:56.300
<i>Get lost!</i>

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:57.430
-This is USA.
<i>-Fast food?</i>

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.600
BIG! WOW! GOOD! FAST!

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:01.770
<i>How could you be proud and show us</i>
<i>something that can be done in 12 seconds?</i>

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:03.810
Well, because our group has three people.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:06.270
<i>To write this shit?</i>
<i>What did the other two do?</i>

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:09.070
-I worked with them.
-It was just a piece of cake for us.

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:10.360
We're seniors after all.

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:12.070
<i>Sixth graders would do better.</i>

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:16.570
-We can help you guys.
-It's okay. We can do this on our own.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:18.700
So, Canada is big, right?

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:19.830
Please don't mind!

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:21.960
And also... Dude! Look out!

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:30.960
RESTARTING SAIKI KUSUO
PART 3

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:33.880
Dude! Look out!

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:38.760
-The book shelf fell down!
-Someone's trapped underneath!

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:40.520
What happened? What was that noise?

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:43.690
How could that happen?
We gotta hurry and move the shelf.

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.190
-Lift that side!
-Come on!

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:49.860
<i>Even without telepathy,</i>
<i>I should have noticed their trap.</i>

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:53.650
<i>I wasn't hurt because I could hold it</i>
<i>with psychokinesis. No, wait...</i>

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:55.530
<i>I'm not supposed to be able to use it.</i>

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:56.990
<i>Then, why am I not hurt?</i>

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.700
Hey, are you all right...

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:01.410
dude?

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:04.000
-It's Nendou! He's trapped under this.
-Saiki, too!

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:06.920
-Did it go well?
-No, that idiot Nendou protected him.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.420
Seriously?

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.090
What went well?

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:12.800
Let me get you an evil spirit!

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:14.970
-Are you all right, Nendou?
-No problem!

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.180
Please be quiet in the library!

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:17.390
Saiki, are you hurt?

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:20.100
I never thought
I'd be protected by someone.

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:25.140
<i>I feel so useless. I shouldn't have</i>
<i>eliminated my psychic abilities after all.</i>

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:26.770
What are you saying?

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:29.940
There is nobody
who has never been protected, ever.

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:33.740
We all help each other.

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:35.780
<i>I see...</i>

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:38.320
<i>I've become someone</i>
<i>who needs to be protected.</i>

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:42.290
Thank you, Nendou.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.540
I was surprised as heck.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:47.920
This shelf isn't likely
to fall down that easily.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.130
It's amazing that Nendou wasn't hurt much.

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:51.710
This is strange.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:55.050
-It seems empty.
-There are too few books on this shelf.

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:03.390
<i>Chuppy was told that he would never be</i>
<i>able to walk again because of his disease,</i>

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:06.600
<i>but his owner and his family devoted</i>
<i>themselves to taking care of him,</i>

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:08.980
<i>and he's fully recovered.</i>

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.190
<i>The family and Chuppy brought</i>
<i>about the miracle.</i>

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:12.980
I am so happy for you, Chuppy!

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.320
Good for you, Chuppy!

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:18.450
<i>Chuppy is still living happily</i>
<i>with the Matsuda family.</i>

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:20.490
The husband must have worked so hard
to save Chuppy.

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:23.030
The wife must have supported him a lot
like you, honey.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.540
No! He's done better like you!

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:28.120
-It must be their love.
-Yes, their true love did that!

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.540
So, he's fully recovered
just like how he used to be.

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.170
Kusuke, you must be moved, too.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:35.260
If I could treat him, I could've improved
his performance five times better.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:36.460
That's not the point!

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:39.180
Weren't you touched by Chuppy
who overcame his disease?

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:42.760
Touched? I don't even know the dog
or his family.

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:45.220
I don't even understand
why they interviewed them.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.270
I see. They have published a book
about the story.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:49.100
They sold 150,000 copies?

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:52.230
With just one dog. They must be laughing
all the way to the bank.

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:54.070
They didn't do that for money!

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:55.780
<i>Their home is full of laughs.</i>

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:56.780
See?

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.110
That's not what they mean!

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:01.450
<i>-So touching, isn't it, Mr. Mugami?</i>
-I think the vet was just a quack.

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:02.570
Then, you're a quack, too.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:04.660
Welcome home, Average Joe!

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:05.990
<i>I need to talk to you.</i>

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:10.790
What? You might be getting
your psychic abilities back?

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:11.920
<i>Why do you look so happy?</i>

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:15.550
<i>I can't be sure,</i>
<i>but I've been experiencing something odd.</i>

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:18.170
You no longer have telepathy,
so can you speak normally?

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:20.630
<i>You used to wear a canceller,</i>
<i>so you can hear me anyway.</i>

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:22.340
<i>Explain to me!</i>

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:25.180
<i>You said I would never be able to use</i>
<i>psychic abilities, right?</i>

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:26.430
<i>Right, I do hear you...</i>

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:27.810
Yeah, I said so.

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:30.520
You shouldn't be able to use
psychic abilities...

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.520
if you are a normal person.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.900
<i>Normal? Is a psychic normal?</i>

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:37.280
I'm talking about you
without psychic abilities.

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:40.860
That means, you're not normal,
even without psychic abilities.

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:45.620
For example, this. You can still do this
without psychic abilities,

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:48.200
but average people can't do such a thing.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:51.500
I assume you have evolved
into a different kind of human being

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:54.920
in order to control
your inborn psychic abilities.

00:11:55.460 --> 00:12:00.220
If your brain and muscles have transformed
to adapt your psychic abilities,

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:02.930
it's possible that you will have
your abilities back.

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:04.260
You'll never know.

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:08.850
However, your power has been sealed,
so nothing serious should be expected.

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:10.560
We'll just wait and see.

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:12.140
Maybe you're just worried too much

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:15.100
or your body is in the process
of becoming normal.

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:18.190
All you can do is just rest.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:21.950
You should not get excited
or think about using psychic abilities.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:24.450
Try to stay calm and live peacefully.

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:26.160
<i>Is that all I should do?</i>

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.700
<i>This is getting interesting.</i>

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:30.540
<i>-Did you say something?</i>
-What are you talking about?

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:35.960
RESTARTING SAIKI KUSUO
PART 4

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:39.050
<i>Was it an auditory hallucination?</i>

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:43.550
<i>It does make sense. I might be physically</i>
<i>different from normal people</i>

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:45.800
<i>considering that my body was dealing</i>
<i>with psychic abilities.</i>

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:48.640
<i>Some say there's a difference between</i>

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.560
<i>brains of right-handed</i>
<i>and left-handed people.</i>

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:52.730
<i>Differences can be distinct for psychics.</i>

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:56.270
<i>This might be similar to recovering</i>
<i>from an illness or an injury.</i>

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:58.690
<i>If I push too hard, I would be sick again</i>
<i>or the wound would open up.</i>

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:01.570
<i>No, I'd better not even think about it.</i>

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:03.700
<i>Just forget about psychic abilities,</i>
<i>and live peacefully.</i>

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:04.700
Hey, dude!

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:06.280
<i>Don't talk...</i>

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:07.240
Yo!

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:09.910
What's wrong, dude?

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:12.790
<i>It's just Nendou,</i>
<i>but did I just see through him?</i>

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:15.500
<i>No, I've been thinking so much</i>
<i>that I saw a hallucination.</i>

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.330
<i>I should stop thinking about it.</i>

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.960
I knew that you'd notice the difference,

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.630
but I didn't mean to scare you

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:25.720
-by getting my trim two degrees lower.
<i>-All right, take a deep breath.</i>

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:27.260
-Morning.
-Yo!

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:28.260
-Good morning!
-Morning.

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:29.180
<i>Good morning.</i>

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:32.430
I tried a matured look as a senior.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:33.640
<i>Your approach</i>
<i>is fundamentally wrong, idiot!</i>

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:36.520
<i>No, that's enough.</i>
<i>Just forget about him.</i>

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:38.980
<i>I think I heard one of their greetings</i>
<i>inside my head,</i>

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.480
<i>but don't worry, just stay calm.</i>

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.070
<i>I'm an Average Joe.</i>

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.240
Saiki.

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:50.070
Did it hurt after the accident?

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:51.080
No.

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:52.700
I'm so relieved!

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.660
Kokomi.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:57.210
What is it, Chiyo?
Talk to you later.

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:59.330
Have you completed the research
about Canada?

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:01.420
Alone with Saiki?

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:03.380
Yeah, we have.

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:06.170
How about you?

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:11.050
We didn't finish it at school, so I asked
Kaidou to do the rest at a cafe,

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:13.140
but he left because he had tutoring.

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:16.100
As a matter of fact,
I'm going to the same tutoring school,

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:18.600
and we can use the study room
of the school,

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:21.610
so I decided to do the research there
while waiting for him

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:24.860
and I was going to email him about it,
then...

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:27.860
Chiyo! Your face is melting!

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:30.450
Hey, Saiki! The incident at the library
was such a disaster, wasn't it?

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:34.080
Speaking of which, I heard that some books
have gone missing from the library.

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:36.160
-For real? Did you know that?
-This...

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.120
<i>No. I just know that it wasn't me.</i>

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.210
Could it be the Dark Reunion
trying to steal

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:41.630
the dragon's silk thread from the library?

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.290
<i>Yes, they did, not me.</i>

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:45.250
-This is odd...
-What is it, Aren?

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:47.050
My key's gone.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:49.470
-Did you drop it?
-I thought I had it in my pocket.

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:51.180
Saiki, did you see it?

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:52.600
<i>How should I know?</i>

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:54.510
<i>I'm just an Average Joe.</i>

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:57.180
ERASE ERASE ERASE

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:58.520
What're you doing, Saiki?

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:01.600
-Could it be in the cabinet?
-Yeah, I was practicing my axe kick.

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:04.820
<i>It can't be. It was a hallucination,</i>
<i>not the second sight.</i>

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.530
-Look at the books!
-Those are library books!

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:08.610
<i>Not the key?</i>

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.490
-Why are these in here?
<i>-Good, it wasn't his key.</i>

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.990
<i>What? I've got something in my mouth.</i>

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:15.200
<i>Well, I'm not familiar with this ability.</i>

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:18.370
Hey, that's my key. Thanks!

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:20.420
-Why is this wet?
-You found it?

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:22.880
<i>No, this isn't a psychic ability.</i>
<i>It just happened to be in my mouth</i>

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.750
<i>because I have a habit</i>
<i>of opening my mouth wide.</i>

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:25.840
Don't lose it again.

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:28.460
Sorry.
Thank you for finding my key, Saiki.

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:30.550
Saiki? Where did he go?

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.550
-Saiki!
-I think he went to the restroom.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.510
<i>I'm here...</i>

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:34.890
Let's go check the restroom.

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:38.020
<i>They must just be kidding.</i>
<i>They are just pretending not to see me.</i>

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:40.480
<i>Well, really, they love to play pranks.</i>

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:43.940
<i>If I'm invisible, I'd be in trouble</i>
<i>if someone touches me.</i>

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:46.480
<i>-Gosh!</i>
-What's wrong? You're spacing out.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:49.400
<i>Toritsuka!</i>
<i>See? I wasn't invisible.</i>

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:52.280
<i>I recall Toritsuka could see me</i>
<i>even if I get invisible, though.</i>

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:53.570
<i>No, it was their prank after all.</i>

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:57.370
You know, there are freshmen
as the new school year has begun.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.540
So I went to check their classes,
but all the pretty girls have boyfriends!

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:02.460
Those young people lack morals!

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.670
Look who's talking.

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:07.090
I am the exception!

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:09.670
<i>Should I ignore him? But I can see him.</i>

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:15.640
Those young people are rather
not interested in having relationships.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:16.680
<i>Who the hell are you?</i>

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:18.560
What? Who are you talking about?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:20.890
<i>-No, forget it. I don't see him!</i>
-Do you mean this guy?

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:22.730
<i>I'm not supposed to see a ghost. I'm not!</i>

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:25.810
He is Haruna, a freshman.
I brought him here. Doesn't he look old?

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:27.610
-What's up?
<i>-Screw you!</i>

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:30.740
<i>Don't scare me, please.</i>
<i>I thought he was a ghost.</i>

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:33.240
By the way,
why can you still use telepathy?

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:41.000
RESTARTING SAIKI KUSUO
PART 5

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:43.210
Saiki...

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:47.290
Don't tell me that you've got
your psychic abilities back!

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:48.460
<i>Why do you look so happy?</i>

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:51.090
For real? Is this the resurrection
of Saiki the Psychic?

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.170
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:53.760
It'll be our reign again?

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:55.260
<i>Get lost!</i>

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:56.180
FLASH

00:16:58.640 --> 00:16:59.560
<i>I'm...</i>

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.220
<i>home...</i>

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:03.180
<i>Great! I was just dreaming.</i>

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:04.520
Hey, don't scare me like that.

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:08.690
I almost spilled my coffee because
you teleported here all of a sudden.

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:09.980
<i>Kusuke! What?</i>

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:12.530
So, you are really getting
your psychic abilities back.

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.200
<i>No, I was just dreaming.</i>

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:16.240
I told you to get some rest.

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:18.070
<i>I did! It wasn't what you think.</i>

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.160
<i>I did not teleport!</i>

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:21.370
Well, it's good that you have
your abilities back

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.160
because I want you to do me a favor.

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:24.290
-I'm currently...
<i>-No!</i>

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:27.420
Right.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:29.840
-You've already sealed your abilities.
<i>-That's right.</i>

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:32.880
<i>No more playing hero.</i>

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:34.760
<i>I've become an average human being.</i>

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:38.090
<i>I will live my everyday life peacefully.</i>

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:39.550
Right.

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:41.470
That was your dream, wasn't it?

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:44.640
So, how do you feel now?

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:46.270
Anything good happen?

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:51.570
Well, forget about it.

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:53.530
I will try to figure out the problem
on my own.

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:56.320
All right, I'm going to do my best
for your peaceful life.

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:58.530
<i>-The problem?</i>
-That's nothing.

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.830
I just got a request from the government.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:02.540
It will be covered on the news soon.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:04.910
<i>I will solve every single case!</i>

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.500
MAGICAL-EYED DETECTIVE JOKER

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.040
<i>I don't even miss a single hint.</i>

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.080
BREAKING NEWS

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.130
<i>This is a breaking news story!</i>

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:12.380
<i>The government just made an announcement</i>

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:14.760
<i>that a gigantic meteorite</i>
<i>is heading down to Earth!</i>

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.840
<i>A warning has been issued</i>
<i>to all of Japan.</i>

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:19.390
<i>I repeat.</i>
<i>A gigantic meteorite is heading...</i>

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:22.640
They told me to do something about it.
Isn't it a very absurd request?

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:24.310
We only have two hours left.

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:27.980
But, don't you worry, Kusuo.
I will try to figure out on my own.

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:30.480
<i>-But, how?</i>
-Hey, Kusuke.

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:31.520
Here is our savior.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:32.650
Well...

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:36.280
I have put this on as told.
What is this anyway?

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:37.240
<i>You idiot!</i>

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:39.490
Yeah, that's perfect. Let's go.

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:40.530
Where to?

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:41.950
<i>No way! Wait a minute!</i>

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:46.000
<i>This is an emergency,</i>
<i>but everybody, please stay calm.</i>

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:47.540
<i>Please stay inside.</i>

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:50.250
<i>This is impossible.</i>
<i>There's nothing I can do about it.</i>

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:51.330
<i>And stay away from...</i>

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:54.050
<i>I'm just an average guy.</i>

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:58.590
<i>I no longer have psychic abilities...</i>

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:00.130
<i>What?</i>

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:02.300
<i>Is something falling down?</i>

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:03.300
<i>It's a meteorite, idiot!</i>

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:06.020
Is it about the Dark Reunion?

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:09.230
-Stop joking and evacuate now!
-Was it a joke?

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:10.650
But the meteorite is no joke...

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:12.360
<i>This is not good, Saiki!</i>

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:15.320
<i>You may not hear me,</i>
<i>but please do something!</i>

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.570
<i>I don't wanna die</i>
<i>without ever having a girlfriend!</i>

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:19.740
Hey, my crystal didn't show me a thing!

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:20.990
I'm dying!

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:23.280
I wanna confess my feelings to Kaidou
before I die.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.740
Everybody, calm down!
Remember the fire drill!

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:29.210
-Mera-san!
-How much would a meteorite sell for?

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:31.080
Master! Please get inside the shelter!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:33.790
-No, please take my friends!
-We have no time!

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:35.290
No, I'm scared of the meteorite!

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:38.380
Will you guys protect me? Hey, hold on!
Aren't you guys my fans?

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:40.760
Well, we are in big trouble.

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:44.100
If that size of asteroid hits the Earth,
to estimate the damage of the impact...

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:45.810
My brain is not working.

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:49.810
The news said it'll take several hours
but my estimate would be two hours or so.

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:53.480
I'm possibly going to pee in my pants,
I am peeing right now.

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:54.730
<i>-Teruhashi-san!</i>
<i>-Teruhashi-san!</i>

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:58.480
-Let's get out of here!
-We'll risk our lives to protect you!

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:02.360
The meteorite can't kill me
because God loves me.

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:06.450
I will never let this happen.
I haven't made Saiki say "Wow" yet.

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:09.200
<i>Do something, God!</i>

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:19.840
-No, no, no, I can't!
-It'll be all right.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.130
What's that noise?

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:23.800
<i>So, my life in peace is over now.</i>

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:27.510
<i>But I actually feel</i>
<i>that's not bad at all.</i>

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:30.520
<i>Perhaps, I like to deal with hassles</i>
<i>after all.</i>

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:32.980
<i>Oh, well...</i>

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:40.070
<i>My name is Kusuo Saiki.</i>
<i>I'm a psychic.</i>

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:07.110
Subtitle translation by Kanako Murakoshi
